#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:4
msgid "把数据用于实验前，先确认它的字段含义、单位、来源和版本。本页介绍数据资产的使用与打包；实验产生的 replay 数据见 :doc:`storage`。"
msgstr ""
"Before using data in an experiment, check field meanings, units, provenance, and "
"version. This page covers data asset use and packaging; see :doc:`storage` for replay"
" data generated by experiments."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:7
msgid "三类数据放在哪里"
