#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:27
msgid "发现与下载"
msgstr "Discover and download"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:29
msgid "在已初始化并同步了 ``agentsociety-use-dataset`` 的工作区根目录，使用安装 SDK 的 Python 环境运行："
msgstr ""
"From the root of an initialized workspace with ``agentsociety-use-dataset`` synced, "
"use the Python environment containing the SDK:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:31
msgid ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py use-dataset list\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py use-dataset search --category agent_profiles --limit 10"
msgstr ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py use-dataset list\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py use-dataset search --category agent_profiles --limit 10"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:36
msgid ""
"``list`` 默认查看本地数据集；加 ``--all`` 合并本地与远程目录，加 ``--remote`` "
"只查看远程目录。搜索和下载访问平台数据服务，与本地仿真后端是不同服务。"
msgstr ""
"``list`` shows local datasets by default; add ``--all`` to merge local and remote "
"catalogs, or ``--remote`` for the remote catalog only. Search and download access the"
" platform data service, which is separate from the local simulation backend."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:38
msgid ""
"选定实际数据集编号后，依次查看 ``info <id>``、``readme <id>``、``files <id>``，再执行 ``download "
"<id>``。默认下载到 ``datasets/<id>/``；使用 ``cat <id> <path>`` 查看本地文件。命令参数可用相应子命令的 ``--help``"
" 查询。"
msgstr ""
"After selecting an actual dataset ID, inspect ``info <id>``, ``readme <id>``, and "
"``files <id>`` before running ``download <id>``. Downloads go to ``datasets/<id>/`` "
"by default. Use ``cat <id> <path>`` to inspect a local file. Check each subcommand’s "
"``--help`` for parameters."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:40
msgid "README 应说明数据来源、采样范围、字段单位、缺失值与编码、文件之间的关联，以及必要的访问或处理方法。这些说明帮助研究助手理解数据的含义与使用条件，减少对缩写、单位和表间关系的误读。"
msgstr ""
"The README should explain data sources, sampling scope, field units, missing values, encodings, "
"relationships between files, and any access or processing steps. These notes help the research "
"assistant interpret the data and its usage conditions, reducing misunderstandings of "
"abbreviations, units, and table relationships."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:43
msgid "如何用于实验"
msgstr "Use data in an experiment"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:45
msgid "对照研究问题选择字段，记录筛选、清洗和抽样方法。"
msgstr ""
"Select fields for the research question and record filtering, cleaning, and sampling "
"procedures."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:46
msgid "将需要的字段映射为 Agent 画像、环境初始状态或结果比较指标。"
msgstr ""
"Map the required fields to agent profiles, initial environment state, or comparison "
"metrics."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:47
msgid "在实验说明中记录数据集编号、版本和处理产物路径，再生成或修改实验配置。"
msgstr ""
"Record the dataset ID, version, and processed output paths in the experiment "
"description, then generate or update the configuration."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:48
msgid "先检查输入规模与配置是否一致，再按 :doc:`research_workflow` 推进实验。"
msgstr ""
"Check that input size agrees with the configuration, then follow "
":doc:`research_workflow`."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:50
msgid "下载不会自动修改 ``init_config.json`` 或启动仿真；数据如何进入模型，由实验配置和模块实现决定。"
msgstr ""
"Downloading does not automatically modify ``init_config.json`` or start a simulation."
" Experiment configuration and module implementation determine how data enters the "
"model."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:53
msgid "整理自己的数据集"
msgstr "Prepare your own dataset"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:55
msgid "在技能管理中同步 ``agentsociety-create-dataset`` 后，可将研究数据整理为以下结构："
msgstr ""
"After syncing ``agentsociety-create-dataset`` in skill management, organize research "
"data as follows:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:57
msgid ""
"<dataset-id>/\n"
"├── README.md\n"
"├── dataset.json\n"
"└── data/"
msgstr ""
"<dataset-id>/\n"
"├── README.md\n"
"├── dataset.json\n"
"└── data/"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:64
msgid ""
"``dataset.json`` 的必填字段为 "
"``id``、``name``、``description``、``category``、``version``、``author``，还可记录 ``tags`` 和 "
"``license``。编号使用小写字母、数字、下划线或连字符；分类支持 "
"``agent_profiles``、``surveys``、``experiments``、``literature``、``simulation_results``、``other``。"
msgstr ""
"``dataset.json`` requires ``id``, ``name``, ``description``, ``category``, "
"``version``, and ``author``; it can also record ``tags`` and ``license``. IDs use "
"lowercase letters, digits, underscores, or hyphens. Supported categories are "
"``agent_profiles``, ``surveys``, ``experiments``, ``literature``, "
"``simulation_results``, and ``other``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:66
msgid ""
"使用 ``create-dataset init <name>`` 初始化，补齐说明与数据后，运行 ``create-dataset validate "
"<path>``，再用 ``create-dataset pack <dir>`` "
"打包。校验器会报告缺失元信息和数据目录问题；通过校验不代表字段语义或研究适用性已获确认。"
msgstr ""
"Initialize with ``create-dataset init <name>``, complete the documentation and data, "
"run ``create-dataset validate <path>``, then package with ``create-dataset pack "
"<dir>``. The validator reports missing metadata and data directory issues; passing "
"validation does not confirm field semantics or research suitability."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:68
msgid ""
"本地创建、校验与打包不要求平台登录。上传前运行 ``create-dataset login``，通过 ``upload <zip>`` 上传；需要公开流转时，再用 "
"``submit <dataset_id>`` 提交审核。平台权限与审核状态以当前服务返回为准。"
msgstr ""
"Local creation, validation, and packaging do not require platform login. Before "
"uploading, run ``create-dataset login``, then ``upload <zip>``. To request "
"publication, use ``submit <dataset_id>`` for review. Current service responses "
"determine permissions and review status."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/datasets.rst:70
msgid ""
"下载后的 ``metadata.json`` 保存本地安装元信息，与上传包中的 ``dataset.json`` "
"用途不同；不要为了让项目树显示而改写数据来源或版本。共享整个研究项目的方法见 :doc:`user_guide`。"
msgstr ""
"The downloaded ``metadata.json`` stores local installation metadata, unlike "
"``dataset.json`` in an upload package. Do not change provenance or version merely to "
"display a dataset in the project tree. See :doc:`user_guide` to share a whole "
"research project."
